1
00:00:02,072 --> 00:00:04,802
Season three is two adventures in one.

2
00:00:04,822 --> 00:00:07,502
First, a war between Earth and Mars

3
00:00:07,522 --> 00:00:09,752
that someone wants very badly.

4
00:00:09,772 --> 00:00:12,277
Then, a giant alien Ring appears at

5
00:00:12,297 --> 00:00:14,102
the edge of the solar system,

6
00:00:14,122 --> 00:00:16,327
and everyone races to reach it.

7
00:00:16,347 --> 00:00:18,682
Old enemies have to become allies,

8
00:00:18,702 --> 00:00:20,657
and the Rocinante crew is right in

9
00:00:20,677 --> 00:00:21,707
the middle.

10
00:00:21,727 --> 00:00:24,607
Three stories carry us through both halves.

11
00:00:24,627 --> 00:00:25,899
Spoilers ahead!

12
00:00:26,648 --> 00:00:29,453
Story one: Avasarala and Bobbie.

13
00:00:29,473 --> 00:00:31,828
They escape from Jules-Pierre Mao's yacht with

14
00:00:31,848 --> 00:00:34,568
proof that Errinwright is behind the war.

15
00:00:34,588 --> 00:00:36,568
He has convinced Earth's leaders to strike

16
00:00:36,588 --> 00:00:37,988
Mars first.

17
00:00:38,053 --> 00:00:39,058
But the two of them are cut

18
00:00:39,078 --> 00:00:40,758
off from Earth and hunted,

19
00:00:40,778 --> 00:00:42,333
with their message blocked,

20
00:00:42,353 --> 00:00:44,908
and nobody in power wants to listen.

21
00:00:44,928 --> 00:00:45,729
They need a ship,

22
00:00:45,749 --> 00:00:48,048
a signal, and a friend.

23
00:00:48,068 --> 00:00:50,923
Bobbie's armor and Avasarala's stubbornness keep them

24
00:00:50,943 --> 00:00:53,356
alive long enough to find all three.

25
00:00:53,991 --> 00:00:55,546
They find the Rocinante,

26
00:00:55,566 --> 00:00:57,271
and help on Earth comes from Anna

27
00:00:57,291 --> 00:01:00,431
Volovodov, a pastor who finds Errinwright's own

28
00:01:00,451 --> 00:01:01,756
recordings.

29
00:01:01,776 --> 00:01:04,906
Secretary-General Sorrento-Gillis hears it straight from his

30
00:01:04,926 --> 00:01:06,781
own advisor's mouth.

31
00:01:06,801 --> 00:01:08,181
The truth gets out,

32
00:01:08,201 --> 00:01:09,596
Errinwright is arrested,

33
00:01:09,616 --> 00:01:11,221
and the war stops.

34
00:01:11,241 --> 00:01:13,546
Mars and Earth count the cost.

35
00:01:13,566 --> 00:01:15,666
And Avasarala, back in charge,

36
00:01:15,686 --> 00:01:17,566
makes a surprising choice:

37
00:01:17,586 --> 00:01:19,966
she offers peace instead of revenge.

38
00:01:20,715 --> 00:01:23,195
Story two: the Rocinante.

39
00:01:23,215 --> 00:01:25,070
Prax still believes his daughter Mei is

40
00:01:25,090 --> 00:01:26,870
alive, and he's right.

41
00:01:26,890 --> 00:01:28,645
The trail leads to Io,

42
00:01:28,665 --> 00:01:30,770
where Jules-Pierre Mao built a lab to

43
00:01:30,790 --> 00:01:33,445
turn the protomolecule into a weapon.

44
00:01:33,465 --> 00:01:35,900
Amos, Bobbie, and the crew land,

45
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:36,975
fight their way in,

46
00:01:36,995 --> 00:01:39,400
and rescue Mei and the other children.

47
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:42,075
Prax finally holds his daughter again.

48
00:01:42,095 --> 00:01:44,751
Doctor Strickland's experiments end for good.

49
00:01:45,422 --> 00:01:47,552
But the lab has already launched hybrid

50
00:01:47,572 --> 00:01:49,152
pods toward Mars,

51
00:01:49,172 --> 00:01:51,327
each one a monster in a missile.

52
00:01:51,347 --> 00:01:54,527
They're stealthy and nearly impossible to track.

53
00:01:54,547 --> 00:01:57,052
The crew switches the pods' transponders back

54
00:01:57,072 --> 00:01:59,287
on, so Mars and the Belt can

55
00:01:59,307 --> 00:02:00,637
shoot them down.

56
00:02:00,657 --> 00:02:03,012
Almost all of them are stopped.

57
00:02:03,032 --> 00:02:04,812
One reaches Earth's flagship,

58
00:02:04,832 --> 00:02:05,987
the Agatha King,

59
00:02:06,007 --> 00:02:07,465
and the ship is lost.

60
00:02:08,204 --> 00:02:10,134
Story three: the Ring.

61
00:02:10,154 --> 00:02:12,309
The protomolecule on Venus rises,

62
00:02:12,329 --> 00:02:13,759
flies out past Uranus,

63
00:02:13,779 --> 00:02:15,534
and builds a huge Ring.

64
00:02:15,554 --> 00:02:16,459
It just sits there,

65
00:02:16,479 --> 00:02:18,909
silent, and that's what makes it scary.

66
00:02:18,929 --> 00:02:20,969
Earth, Mars, and the Belt all send

67
00:02:20,989 --> 00:02:21,869
ships.

68
00:02:21,889 --> 00:02:24,269
Drummer and Ashford command the Belt's giant

69
00:02:24,289 --> 00:02:25,969
ship, the Behemoth.

70
00:02:25,989 --> 00:02:27,594
Anna joins Earth's fleet,

71
00:02:27,614 --> 00:02:28,744
and Clarissa Mao,

72
00:02:28,764 --> 00:02:31,419
Julie's sister, sneaks along with a plan

73
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:33,066
for revenge on Holden.

74
00:02:33,754 --> 00:02:35,634
Through the Ring is a strange station

75
00:02:35,654 --> 00:02:37,084
with a speed limit.

76
00:02:37,104 --> 00:02:39,134
It treats every ship as a threat,

77
00:02:39,154 --> 00:02:41,359
and anything that moves too fast gets

78
00:02:41,379 --> 00:02:43,059
frozen in place.

79
00:02:43,079 --> 00:02:45,109
Ashford wants to destroy the station,

80
00:02:45,129 --> 00:02:48,034
but Holden, guided by a ghostly Miller,

81
00:02:48,054 --> 00:02:50,834
gets every ship to power down instead.

82
00:02:50,854 --> 00:02:53,574
Even Clarissa, who came to ruin Holden,

83
00:02:53,594 --> 00:02:55,824
flips the switch that saves them.

84
00:02:55,844 --> 00:02:57,124
Then, all around them,

85
00:02:57,144 --> 00:02:58,327
new gates open.

86
00:02:59,069 --> 00:03:01,524
Season three ends with the gates wide

87
00:03:01,544 --> 00:03:04,249
open: more than a thousand doorways to

88
00:03:04,269 --> 00:03:05,999
new star systems.

89
00:03:06,019 --> 00:03:08,494
Humanity survived its own war,

90
00:03:08,514 --> 00:03:10,469
and the three powers stood together long

91
00:03:10,489 --> 00:03:11,794
enough to find a path to the

92
00:03:11,814 --> 00:03:13,044
stars.

93
00:03:13,064 --> 00:03:14,594
On the other side of those gates

94
00:03:14,614 --> 00:03:17,419
are worlds no human has ever seen.

95
00:03:17,439 --> 00:03:19,319
The solar system just got a lot

96
00:03:19,339 --> 00:03:22,185
bigger, and the adventure is only beginning.

